# Required sizes:
# - as a viewable icon, when registering the ClayPaintInfo:
#   * 16 (scaled) in status bar
#     See clay_statusbar_vprintf()
#   * as action icon:
#     + menu
#     + action search: an icon in GtkCellRendererPixbuf (see
#     ClaySearchPopup), whose default icon size is GTK_ICON_SIZE_MENU
#     (16px).
# - In device status.
# - In Tool Preset Editor:
#   * Header as GTK_ICON_SIZE_MENU (16px)
#     See clay_tool_preset_editor_sync_data()
#   * Button as icon picker CLAY_VIEW_SIZE_SMALL (24px)
#     See clay_icon_picker_constructed()
# - Toolbox default (DEFAULT_TOOL_ICON_SIZE) is GTK_ICON_SIZE_BUTTON (16px)
#   Yet System theme sets:
#   -ClayToolPalette-tool-icon-size:   large-toolbar; (24px)
